almostIncluded.description:
Activate Ant Queen by paying {1}{G}, creating a creature token
Activate Earthcraft by tapping the creature token, untapping a basic Forest.
Activate the Forest by tapping it, adding {G}
Wild Growth triggers, adding {G}
Repeat

